        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "35877402-99d1-533a-b6fa-9db242fde269",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Suresh Peters, S.P. Venkatesh\n- Works: \"Chikku Bukku Rayile\", \"Gentleman\", \"Punjabi House\", \"Chup Chup Ke\", \"Khatta Meetha\"\n- Roles: music director, playback rapper/singer, film composer\n- Topics: Indian films, Tamil songs, film adaptation\n\nFacts:\n- Suresh Peters is an Indian film music director and playback rapper/singer.\n- \"Chikku Bukku Rayile\" is a Tamil song featured in the 1993 Tamil film \"Gentleman\".\n- \"Chikku Bukku Rayile\" is one of Suresh Peters's notable songs.\n- In the 1998 Malayalam film \"Punjabi House\", Suresh Peters composed the songs and made his debut as a film composer.\n- In \"Punjabi House\", S.P. Venkatesh composed the score.\n- The film \"Chup Chup Ke\" was originally titled \"Khatta Meetha\".\n- The story of \"Chup Chup Ke\" was adapted from the 1998 Malayalam film \"Punjabi House\".",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
